  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      478.68,
      277.08,
      496.37
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Land or Servitude to be Acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldItal",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.959303855895996,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      497.84,
      286.41,
      588.56
    ],
    "text": "The land allotments of land described below in total extent of 0.0671 Hectares, shown as Lot 1 in the preliminary plan dated 03.12.2018 for Gam 4121 prepared by the Surveyor General situated in Village of Nawammahara, the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 179, Elapitiwela the minor division of Ragam Paththuwa in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Wattala in the District of Gampaha, in western province and bounded as follows:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      590.0,
      286.43,
      645.92
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot No. 01 Name of the Land: Kajugahakumbura; Description of Land : Open Marshy Land; Claimant: Padmika Gayan Ruwanpura, No.79/2, Temple Lane, Papiliyana Road,",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.9994001388549805,
      7.91920804977417,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      346.16,
      539.62,
      367.76
    ],
    "text": "Nedimala, Dehiwela; Original Claimant: -; Extent : 0.0671 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      369.87,
      539.65,
      498.8
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid is hereby required to appear personally or by agents duly authorized in writing before me at Divisional Secretariat Wattala on the 20th Day of March 2019 at 10.00 a.m and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 20th Day of March 2019 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
